        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The addressee has personal agency and judgment about their own effectiveness within the committee.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Policy impact should be evaluated based on perceived ability to contribute meaningfully to legislation.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts the addressee’s self-assessment of their role and influence.",
