    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72838.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. You know, people do think it's a little odd that I'm from Cleveland and I sit on the committee. But let me just suggest to you that I am excited about the opportunity to give a different view from what they, under normal circumstances, would get that the committee has historically been very farm-based. And I think that when you look at agriculture, it encompasses so many more things. So I'm just happy to be a part of broadening the perspective and the discussion about what kinds of things we can do with the farm bill.",
