        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Broadening perspectives will lead to better outcomes in shaping the farm bill.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Being from Cleveland gives me access to non-farm-related experiences relevant to agricultural policy.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members value inclusivity and diversity of input in policymaking.",
