    "turn_text": "voted against it and I spoke against it as well. One of the major issues for me clearly was a $16 billion cut to SNAP as well as the change in the eligibility requirements to qualify for SNAP. And there were some other things as well, certainly as it relates to 1890 institutions and other things, but in particular, my biggest concern was that you cannot, in this economy, cut $16 billion from SNAP. So that was my biggest issue with the bill.",
