        "text": "More liberal policies under the Obama administration could result in expanded eligibility for federal benefits.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker expects the listener to recognize the relevance of economic conditions and policy changes as explanatory factors.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener has sufficient knowledge to evaluate whether economic decline or policy shifts are responsible.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Eligibility increases in public programs are primarily driven by either macroeconomic trends or intentional policy decisions.",
