        "text": "The current situation with food stamps is due to a worsening economy.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "I do not personally desire for people to rely on food stamps.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A reduction in food stamp usage indicates economic growth.",
