        "text": "Economic decline directly causes increased reliance on public assistance like food stamps.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Reduced dependence on food stamps reflects improved individual well-being and broader prosperity.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has moral concern for individuals affected by poverty.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a shared understanding between speaker and audience about what constitutes a healthy economy.",
