      },
      {
        "text": "Policy changes regarding food stamps should consider macroeconomic conditions.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 72838,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72838.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "You have been critical of the obesity of young people and have dedicated yourself to try to overcome that in one generation. It seems almost a contradiction that we have obesity because of people being short of money and the strangeness of that in our society that hunger and obesity are not simple problems to fix.",
